{"id":3208,"slug":"3208-v-model-hoat-dong-the-nao-custom-v-model","category":"Vue.js","subcategory":"Directives","level":"intermediate","question_vi":"v-model hoạt động thế nào? Custom v-model?","question_en":"How does v-model work? Custom v-model?","answer_vi":"`v-model` là shorthand: `:modelValue` + `@update:modelValue`. Mặc định cho input:\n```vue\n<!-- Tương đương -->\n<input v-model=\"name\" />\n<input :value=\"name\" @input=\"name = $event.target.value\" />\n```\nCustom component v-model:\n```vue\n<script setup>\n// Child component\nconst props = defineProps(['modelValue'])\nconst emit = defineEmits(['update:modelValue'])\n// Template: :value=\"modelValue\" @input=\"emit('update:modelValue', $event.target.value)\"\n</script>\n```\nVue 3 hỗ trợ multiple v-model: `v-model:title`, `v-model:content` với props tương ứng.","answer_en":"`v-model` is shorthand: `:modelValue` + `@update:modelValue`. Default for input:\n```vue\n<!-- Equivalent -->\n<input v-model=\"name\" />\n<input :value=\"name\" @input=\"name = $event.target.value\" />\n```\nCustom component v-model:\n```vue\n<script setup>\nconst props = defineProps(['modelValue'])\nconst emit = defineEmits(['update:modelValue'])\n// Template: :value=\"modelValue\" @input=\"emit('update:modelValue', $event.target.value)\"\n</script>\n```\nVue 3 supports multiple v-models: `v-model:title`, `v-model:content` with matching props.","answer_html_vi":"<p class=\"qa-summary\"><code>v-model</code> là shorthand: <code>:modelValue</code> + <code>@update:modelValue</code>.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Mặc định cho input:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">vue</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- Tương đương --&gt;\n&lt;input v-model=&quot;name&quot; /&gt;\n&lt;input :value=&quot;name&quot; @input=&quot;name = $event.target.value&quot; /&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- Tương đương --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">v-model</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;name&quot;</span> /&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">:value</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;name&quot;</span> @<span class=\"hljs-attr\">input</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;name = $event.target.value&quot;</span> /&gt;</span></code></pre></div><p>Custom component v-model:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">vue</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;script setup&gt;\n// Child component\nconst props = defineProps(['modelValue'])\nconst emit = defineEmits(['update:modelValue'])\n// Template: :value=&quot;modelValue&quot; @input=&quot;emit('update:modelValue', $event.target.value)&quot;\n&lt;/script&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">script</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">setup</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"language-javascript\">\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Child component</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> props = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">defineProps</span>([<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;modelValue&#x27;</span>])\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> emit = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">defineEmits</span>([<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;update:modelValue&#x27;</span>])\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Template: :value=&quot;modelValue&quot; @input=&quot;emit(&#x27;update:modelValue&#x27;, $event.target.value)&quot;</span>\n</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">script</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div><p>Vue 3 hỗ trợ multiple v-model: <code>v-model:title</code>, <code>v-model:content</code> với props tương ứng.</p>","answer_html_en":"<p class=\"qa-summary\"><code>v-model</code> is shorthand: <code>:modelValue</code> + <code>@update:modelValue</code>.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Default for input:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">vue</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- Equivalent --&gt;\n&lt;input v-model=&quot;name&quot; /&gt;\n&lt;input :value=&quot;name&quot; @input=&quot;name = $event.target.value&quot; /&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"